        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prairie_City%2C_Iowa"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Many artifacts from Prairie City's history are housed in the museum, including the Dowden Potato Digger, originally manufactured in Prairie City.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
